{
  "description": "Fixed word lists for Heard from, in English, German, French and Kiswahili. Same for every operator. The heard story is split at the first reporting verb: the source span (who told them) is everything before it, the content span (what they heard) everything after. Rules run on the source span; the on-device model is used only when no rule fires.",
  "note": "Written for this project. Matching ignores case and accents, and apostrophes count as spaces, so l'hôte matches hôte and Gastehaus matches Gästehaus. A trailing * matches any ending (erzähl* matches erzählt), a leading * any beginning (*blog matches Reiseblog). Kiswahili lists are review pending.",
